@startuml UC-52
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-52.md
title UC-52: Low-stock Warning
footer Feature INV-02 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-17
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/InventoryController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "InventoryService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Open low-stock list
MVC -> API : GET /api/admin/inventory/low-stock
API -> SVC : GetLowStockAsync()
SVC -> DB : Select active variants\nWHERE StockQuantity <= LowStockThreshold\nORDER BY StockQuantity (BR-17)
DB --> SVC : Rows
SVC --> API : LowStockItemDto[]\n(product name, SKU, size, color, stock, threshold)
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt list empty
  MVC --> U : Show "No variants are low on stock"
else items found
  MVC --> U : Show list with link to Update Stock (UC-51)
end

@enduml
